  "name": "Taiwanese Fried Rice Noodles",
  "subtitle": "Savory rice vermicelli with pork and crisp vegetables",
  "description": "Tender rice noodles are stir-fried with marinated pork, mushrooms, shrimp, egg, and fresh vegetables, then finished with cilantro.",
